            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/660400/extras/8a41d27d229b34a49051f0a0456acafb.avif?t=1789811736\" width=600 height=130 /></span><br><br>Squarehead is a pixel art-action-jump &amp; run game set in a comic style.<br>You need to shoot, jump &amp; teleport through forests, caves, deserts, and snowy landscapes,<br>to refuel your ship with diamonds. Fight enemies and solve tricky jumps to reach the end.<br><br>Features: 40+ Lvl / 6 secret areas / automatic saving &amp; loading / highscore / 23 steam achievements<br>The game has full support for the xbox360 gamepad!",
